3. examples/audio/two_speakers_10s.wav is made from two LibriSpeech test-clean utterances, CC-BY-4.0
   (Panayotov et al., ICASSP 2015; https://www.openslr.org/12).

4. examples/audio/two_party_call_16s.wav (and its voice print two_party_call_16s.voiceprint.json) is a 16 s excerpt
   of one conversation of otoSpeech-full-duplex-processed-141h by otoearth, CC BY 4.0
   (https://huggingface.co/datasets/otoearth/otoSpeech-full-duplex-processed-141h); the two channels were averaged
   to mono and resampled to 16 kHz, nothing else changed. The dataset card prohibits attempts to identify the
   speakers.
